# @s = server (from rlk:load). Objectives, tunables (README "조절 지점") and the row tables of the balance gauge.
# Generated by tools/build_balance.py: edit the generator, not this file.
scoreboard objectives add bal dummy
scoreboard objectives add balMax dummy
scoreboard objectives add balT dummy
scoreboard objectives add grgT dummy
scoreboard objectives add balC dummy
scoreboard objectives add balF dummy
scoreboard objectives add balQ dummy
scoreboard objectives add balX dummy
# normal: 4 pips, groggy 60 t (damage taken 150 %), regen after 200 t then +1 pip per 60 t
scoreboard players set #pips1 bal 4
scoreboard players set #grg1 bal 60
scoreboard players set #amp1 bal 150
scoreboard players set #rd1 bal 200
scoreboard players set #rs1 bal 60
# elite: 7 pips, groggy 80 t (damage taken 140 %), regen after 240 t then +1 pip per 80 t
scoreboard players set #pips2 bal 7
scoreboard players set #grg2 bal 80
scoreboard players set #amp2 bal 140
scoreboard players set #rd2 bal 240
scoreboard players set #rs2 bal 80
# boss: 12 pips, groggy 100 t (damage taken 130 %), regen after 300 t then +1 pip per 100 t
scoreboard players set #pips3 bal 12
scoreboard players set #grg3 bal 100
scoreboard players set #amp3 bal 130
scoreboard players set #rd3 bal 300
scoreboard players set #rs3 bal 100
# sources: a burst hit takes 2 pips, once per target per 40 t; strong reactions once per target per 30 t
scoreboard players set #burst bal 2
scoreboard players set #burstGap bal 40
scoreboard players set #rxGap bal 30
scoreboard players set #flash bal 6
scoreboard players set #100 bal 100
